This repository contains modified copies of two crates of LiveKit's Rust
SDKs (https://github.com/livekit/rust-sdks), Copyright 2023-2026 LiveKit,
Inc., licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0: vendor/livekit and
vendor/webrtc-sys. The changes are listed in vendor/README.md and marked
"evre-panda:" in the code.

Panda downloads nothing on its own except LiveKit's prebuilt libwebrtc at
build time (webrtc-sys) and, if PANDA_YTDLP_AUTO_UPDATE is on, new yt-dlp
releases through yt-dlp's own updater. yt-dlp and FFmpeg are separate
programs under their own licences and are not part of this repository.
